-# Filter dropdowns (application/_filter_dropdown) of an index page whose
-# prototype `record` (@filter, see IndexFilters) is built from e.g.
-# params[:kid]. The reset link shows whenever the request filters that
-# scope -- read from the params, not
-# from the dropdowns rendered, since some filters (e.g. the coach) aren't
-# shown to everyone but still apply.
.d-flex.flex-wrap.align-items-center.border.rounded.p-2.mb-3
  = yield
  - if filters_active?(record)
    = link_to 'Filter zurücksetzen', reset_filters_path, class: 'btn btn-link btn-sm ms-auto'
